  "description": "In this goshiwon district lives a man preparing to become a police officer. During the sweltering summer, his neighbor happens to be a lewd gay man. While struggling with an uncertain future and the weight of pressure, the man finds himself eavesdropping on his neighbor’s lustful affairs. Then one day, unexpected news shakes up his suffocating daily life.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/the__end), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/jongmal)",
